# The sample Dockerfile builds from the repository root (it needs the library sources), but only
# src/EasyOcrSharp and samples/EasyOcrSharp.WebApi are actually COPYed. Without this file the daemon
# receives several GB of onnx_models/, test assets and the Python export venv on every build.
#
# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include exactly what the Dockerfile copies.
*

!LICENSE
!README.md
!src/EasyOcrSharp
!samples/EasyOcrSharp.WebApi

# ...minus local build output inside those trees.
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
